{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:22 2026-11-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:22 2026-11-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:22 2026-11-17 HKT</p><p>今(17日)中午1時43分，藍田啟田邨啟旺樓34樓一單位發生火警，從網上影片所見，單位火勢猛烈，烈焰熊熊，黑煙升至半空。消防接報到場出動一喉一煙帽隊撲救，約20分鐘將火救熄，其間近百人自行疏散到地面，一名女住戶吸入濃煙不適送院檢查。大廈外牆嚴重熏黑。消防正調查起火原因。</p><img alt=\"一名女住戶吸入濃煙不適送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b6403bec39b850e56f0f8a25cad6072/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_36_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/784368ef51472b545ad0532ab02cef32/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救熄火警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f410f2207a13532531d306690d68fb4a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_35_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"近百人疏散到地面。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dc5a742530fd476344e51b3146fed11/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位冒煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/428d38152d52ae62648de56b8d9ce7f2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大廈外牆嚴重熏黑。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c28f68a00a3b8853a00c64b0ae05b1e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_33_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d7bb13a8183d968584b642aa698d844/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-17_at_14_42_33.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:10:00.232345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:21.764502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:21.764502+00:00","content_hash":"81827156c7e646f035e14a4ab1d6f6e19d20804d96a740c1a352ece0ad55d443","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}